  "transcript": "This is Creati, an image model made for aesthetics. Create in any style, no matter how expressive. Explore new ideas without stylistic boundaries. Show it a mood board and set the direction for what you want to create. It gets it, it gets you. Tell it what you love and what you don't. It learns and adapts to your visual preferences. The more you use it, the better it gets. With unique controls to adjust its creativity, add randomness or surprise, or tune stylization. Craya 2 is meant to be a base for you to build on. A raw creative medium with no predefined preferences or opinions, and every control for you to make it your own.",
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 1.0,
      "end": 6.04,
      "text": "This is Creati, an image model made for aesthetics."
    },
    {
      "start": 7.12,
      "end": 11.08,
      "text": "Create in any style, no matter how expressive."
    },
    {
      "start": 11.92,
      "end": 14.68,
      "text": "Explore new ideas without stylistic boundaries."
    },
    {
      "start": 15.76,
      "end": 19.74,
      "text": "Show it a mood board and set the direction for what you want to create."
    },
    {
      "start": 20.76,
      "end": 22.48,
      "text": "It gets it, it gets you."
    },
    {
      "start": 23.56,
      "end": 25.7,
      "text": "Tell it what you love and what you don't."
    },
    {
      "start": 25.7,
      "end": 28.8,
      "text": "It learns and adapts to your visual preferences."
    },
    {
      "start": 30.06,
      "end": 34.0,
      "text": "The more you use it, the better it gets."
    },
    {
      "start": 40.64,
      "end": 44.34,
      "text": "With unique controls to adjust its creativity,"
    },
    {
      "start": 44.96,
      "end": 48.68,
      "text": "add randomness or surprise, or tune stylization."
    },
    {
      "start": 51.2,
      "end": 54.96,
      "text": "Craya 2 is meant to be a base for you to build on."
    },
    {
      "start": 55.52,
      "end": 59.9,
      "text": "A raw creative medium with no predefined preferences or opinions,"
    },
    {
      "start": 60.38,
      "end": 63.0,
      "text": "and every control for you to make it your own."
    }
  ],
